{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03弱化了想确认对方是否也有同样感受的念头，S08没有充分展开今天的美好为何不能保证未来，S13也淡化了想把喜欢藏回去以减少未来受伤的心理动机，这几处X交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点加亮和话语、感受分层，让观众能先抓住人物正在经历什么，再随着音乐接触更细的情绪变化；感受按乐句出现，也比X所有短词同时铺开更容易边听边扫。Y的水面、摇荡、光线、熟悉旋律等意象反复呼应，尤其结尾对开头的回应，让音乐和人物心理更像一条连续的经历；不过X对人物每一步为什么犹豫、期待、退缩的解释更完整，心理因果上有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9ed703ee-c11d-4754-a437-13edfe647bab", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T172240232680Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T17:23:51.395360+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67d58f0dee4e73c1e1de45588eb059ba040efca9a7bc0aa8c73db5eeeb2e254c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools